  "final_source": "def is_woodall(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Return True if n is of the form 2**k - 1 for some integer k >= 0.\"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        return False\n    # Check if n+1 is a power of two\n    m = n + 1\n    return (m & (m - 1)) == 0 and m > 0\n\n# Example usage:\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    assert not is_woodall(383)   # standard definition says this should be False\n",
